      Plugin plugin = PluginLoader.load(pluginJar, "example.Plugin");
      assertThat(plugin.name()).isEqualTo("example");
  } catch (Error e) {
      if (!NativeImageSupport.isUnsupportedFeatureError(e)) {
          throw e;
      }
  }
  ```
  
